Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: there is no compliance with the requirements of the rule

52
02:07:07,600 --> 02:07:10,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that the BARC must produce a detailed report

53
02:07:10,800 --> 02:07:13,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of proposed amendments,

54
02:07:14,360 --> 02:07:18,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: it being subcommittee on budget amendments,

55
