Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and that such detailed report be furnished to all members,

56
02:07:25,780 --> 02:07:34,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and that it be published on the website of the House.

57
02:07:35,400 --> 02:07:36,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, Madam Speaker,

58
02:07:38,660 --> 02:07:44,080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: narinig po natin, kahit po dun sa live stream mismo ng BARC,

59
