Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sinabi po ng Chair, our esteemed Chair of the Committee on Appropriations,

60
02:07:49,340 --> 02:07:51,800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na hindi na raw po magpuproduce ng separate

