74
02:08:46,140 --> 02:08:48,440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung controversial na LGSF,

75
02:08:48,440 --> 02:08:53,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dinagdagan ng 4.09 billion yung DPWH,

76
02:08:54,240 --> 02:08:57,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dinagdagan ng 11.49 billion.

77
02:08:59,720 --> 02:09:04,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngunit, hindi naman sinabi, on the other hand,

78
02:09:05,680 --> 02:09:09,340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: saan binawas o saan nanggaling yung mga dagdag na ito.

79
02:09:10,160 --> 02:09:15,740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pangalawa, sa mga increases po,

80
02:09:15,740 --> 02:09:16,900
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: just to align.

81
02:09:17,320 --> 02:09:18,180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo.

82
02:09:18,440 --> 02:09:20,720
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Your point of order is based on

