03:16:29,400 --> 03:16:37,260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to be able to augment whichever funds they need to fund infrastructure projects and operating expenses.

516
03:16:37,620 --> 03:16:44,060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, Madam Speaker, we were also told that out of the 12 billion that we provided for last year,

