530
03:18:22,420 --> 03:18:32,740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And with that, Madam Speaker, our distinguished colleague knows how much I support the advocacy in terms of higher education.

531
03:18:32,740 --> 03:18:36,740
